Changes made in 0.1.0 (2026-11-03):
  - Rebranded user-facing text, page titles, help pages, logo and favicons
    from "OpenRMF OSS" to "AUT0-CH". Original OpenRMF logo artwork removed.
  - New AUT0-CH logo (hex-nut slashed zero) and wordmark set in Montserrat
    ExtraBold (SIL OFL 1.1), converted to outlines; sources in docs/branding/.
  - Removed the OpenRMF Professional advertising from the web UI footer and
    logout page.
  - Excel export document metadata, Swagger titles, Grafana dashboard titles,
    and Keycloak realm display names now read "AUT0-CH".
  - Keycloak login/welcome theme switched from the upstream "openrmf" theme to
    the stock Keycloak theme.
  - docker-compose.yml runs locally built AUT0-CH images for web, api-read,
    api-reports, and msg-reports; all other services use stock upstream images.

Intentionally unchanged (compatibility with stock upstream services and data):
  NATS subjects (openrmf.*), MongoDB database/user names, Keycloak realm and
  client id "openrmf", compose service/container names, C# namespaces, and
  Prometheus metric names.

